<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Shopify-like Homepage</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen,
        Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Open Sans", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #1a1a1a; /* slightly black background */
      color: #ddd;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }


    nav {
      background-color: #222;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #444;
      padding: 1rem 3rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    nav .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      color: #00c18c;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    nav ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    nav ul li a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #ccc;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav ul li a:hover {
      color: #00c18c;
    }

 
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      background: url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/16394145/pexels-photo-16394145.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200') no-repeat center/cover;
      height: 70vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 0 3rem;
      color: white;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      z-index: 1;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    .btn-hero {
      background-color: #00c18c;
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn-hero:hover {
      background-color: #008060;
    }


    .featured-products {
      padding: 3rem;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .featured-products h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .products-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .product-card {
      background: #333;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      padding: 1rem;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .product-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    .product-card img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .product-card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .product-card p {
      color: #bbb;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .product-card button {
      background-color: #00c18c;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .product-card button:hover {
      background-color: #008060;
    }

    footer {
      background-color: #121212;
      color: #aaa;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
      margin-top: 3rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    footer a {
      color: #58a6ff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    footer a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero {
        align-items: center;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="logo">Simba brand</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Products</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Start Your Online Store Today</h1>
    <p>Powerful ecommerce tools to grow your business with ease.</p>
    <button class="btn-hero">Get Started</button>
  </section>

  <section class="featured-products">
    <h2>Featured Products</h2>
    <div class="products-grid">
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/190819/pexels-photo-190819.jpeg" alt="Product 1" /> 
        <h3>Classic Watch</h3>
        <p>Design, perfect for any occasion.</p>
        <button>Add </button>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/298863/pexels-photo-298863.jpeg" alt="Product 2" />
        <h3>Leather Shoes</h3>
        <p>Comfortable and stylish footwear.</p>
        <button>Add</button>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card">
        <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3394664/pexels-photo-3394664.jpeg" alt="Product 3" />
        <h3>Wireless Headphones</h3>
        <p>High quality sound and long battery life.</p>
        <button>Add </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 nahome. All rights reserved. <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="#">Terms of Service</a></p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
